Operating system:
It is software between application process and hardware of computer to provide hardware resources to application process to run smootly.

We have different types of Opearting system those are Window OS , unix OS , Linux OS , Mac OS etc.

In this material we will learn about Linux Operating system

Linux Operating system:
It is software between application process or program and hardware of computer which provide access to computer hardware to run application programs or process on computer.
For example: If python program want to perform any task or execute intstruction it need to access CPU , Memory. program will access computer resource using OS.

